      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fasten off, leaving a 15 cm tail. Thread the tail through a tapestry needle and weave through 3 to 4 stitches along the back of round 5, then back through 2 to 3 stitches in the opposite direction. Trim. Weave in the magic ring tail along the back of round 1 the same way. Steam-block by holding a steam iron 2 to 3 cm above the motif for 10 to 15 seconds, then pin to a blocking mat at the four corners and leave flat to cool completely."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": { "level": 2 },
        "content": [{ "type": "text", "text": "Joining" }]
      },
      {
